{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ (needs Premium)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（需要高级版）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (offline)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（离线）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · Muted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 已静音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接 %lld 台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld processes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个进程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "000000": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "A one-time purchase for this device. Without it, this device plays the Mac's other sound and only one such device can be connected at a time. With Premium, your Mac can send single apps here, and this device can be connected alongside others. SideCast on the Mac is free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为本设备一次性购买。未购买时，本设备只能播放 Mac 的「其他声音」，且同一时间只能连接一台未购买的设备；购买后，Mac 可以把单个应用投到本设备，本设备也可以与其他设备同时连接。Mac 上的 SideCast 免费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A removed device has to enter a new pairing code the next time it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除后，该设备下次连接时需要重新输入配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow SideCast in Login Items to finish turning this on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在「登录项」中允许 SideCast 以完成开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps that play sound appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在发声的应用会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps you don't change play through the Mac as usual. Your choices are remembered for each app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未调整的应用照常从 Mac 发声。你的设置会按应用记住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio keeps playing when you lock the screen or switch apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁屏或切换到其他 App 时，音频会继续播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音频模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both devices are in the same mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两台设备处于相同模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose this Mac as an app's output on the other Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在另一台 Mac 上把某个应用的输出设为这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose this device as an app's output on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上把某个应用的输出设为这台设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Collapsed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已收起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected devices are disconnected and every app plays through this Mac as usual until you switch back. Your settings are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接的设备会断开，所有应用照常从这台 Mac 播放，直到你切换回来。你的设置会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在连接…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not start audio playback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法开始播放音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device offline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备离线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Devices": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Devices signed in to the same Apple ID connect without a pairing code. SideCast stores only each device's name and public key in your iCloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录同一 Apple ID 的设备无需配对码即可连接。SideCast 只会在你的 iCloud 中保存各设备的名称和公钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "诊断信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the code shown on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 %@ 上显示的配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter this code on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 上输入此配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expanded": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已展开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the app's setting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随应用设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forget": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免费"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High quality": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高音质"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In receive mode, another Mac can choose this Mac as an output, like an iPad. This Mac's own apps then play as usual, and SideCast restarts to switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在接收模式下，另一台 Mac 可以像选择 iPad 一样把这台 Mac 选为输出设备；这台 Mac 自己的应用照常播放。切换时 SideCast 会重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets you route and set the volume of each kind of process inside an app separately, for example a browser's helper processes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可对应用内不同类型的进程（例如浏览器的辅助进程）分别设置输出设备和音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地网络"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local network access is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地网络权限已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for Macs running SideCast…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在查找运行 SideCast 的 Mac…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low latency": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低延迟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low latency suits video, calls and games. High quality sends lossless audio with a little more delay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低延迟适合视频、通话和游戏；高音质传输无损音频，延迟稍高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Macs on your Apple ID connect without a pairing code. A removed Mac needs a new pairing code the next time it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一 Apple ID 下的 Mac 无需配对码即可连接。移除的 Mac 下次连接时需要重新输入配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Main process": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主进程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure SideCast is running on your Mac and both devices have Wi-Fi turned on. This device appears on the Mac as “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请确认 Mac 上的 SideCast 正在运行，且两台设备都已打开 Wi-Fi。本设备在 Mac 上显示为“%@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mirror %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "镜像“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mirror screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "镜像屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mirroring %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在镜像“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mute": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "静音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nearby Macs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近的 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nearby devices": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近的设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needed to find and connect to your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于查找并连接你的 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needed to find and connect to your devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于查找并连接你的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needed to take an app's sound and play it on another device or at another volume. SideCast never records or saves audio.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于获取应用的声音，以便在其他设备上或以其他音量播放。SideCast 不会录制或保存音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs Premium on the device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该设备需要高级版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs a pairing code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No devices connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有已连接的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No other devices on your iCloud account have opened SideCast yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 iCloud 账号下还没有其他设备打开过 SideCast。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No paired Macs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有已配对的 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No paired devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有已配对的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No sound is coming from the apps SideCast controls. If they are playing, allow SideCast to record system audio.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 控制的应用没有传来声音。如果它们正在播放，请允许 SideCast 录制系统音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not paired yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. SideCast can't find your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭，SideCast 无法找到你的 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. SideCast can't find your devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭，SideCast 无法找到你的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only one device without SideCast Premium can be connected at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一时间只能连接一台未购买 SideCast 高级版的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only one device without SideCast Premium can be connected at a time. Buy Premium in SideCast on the device to connect it alongside others.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一时间只能连接一台未购买 SideCast 高级版的设备。在该设备的 SideCast 中购买高级版后，即可与其他设备同时连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Login Items": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开登录项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open SideCast on your iPad, iPhone or Vision Pro, or turn on receive mode on another Mac, to see it here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPad、iPhone 或 Vision Pro 上打开 SideCast，或在另一台 Mac 上打开接收模式，它就会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open SideCast on your iPad, iPhone or Vision Pro, or turn on receive mode on another Mac. It appears here when it's on the same Wi-Fi network or nearby.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPad、iPhone 或 Vision Pro 上打开 SideCast，或在另一台 Mac 上打开接收模式。设备在同一 Wi-Fi 网络或在附近时会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open SideCast when you log in": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时打开 SideCast"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Output": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Output for other sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他声音的输出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
