      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast can't find your devices because local network access is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地网络权限已关闭，SideCast 无法找到你的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast could not capture app audio. Check the permission in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 无法获取应用音频，请在系统设置中检查权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast devices": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast isn't allowed to record the screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 没有录制屏幕的权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast needs local network access to find your Mac. Turn it on in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 需要本地网络权限才能找到你的 Mac，请在设置中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast needs local network access to find your Mac. Turn it on in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 需要本地网络权限才能找到你的 Mac。请在系统设置中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast on the Mac is free, including per-app output and volume on this Mac. SideCast Premium is a one-time purchase in SideCast on each iPad, iPhone or Vision Pro. A device with Premium can receive single apps and can be connected alongside other devices; a device without it receives the other sound, one device at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 上的 SideCast 免费，包括在这台 Mac 上分应用设置输出和音量。SideCast 高级版需要在每台 iPad、iPhone 或 Vision Pro 的 SideCast 中一次性购买。已购买的设备可以接收单个应用，并可与其他设备同时连接；未购买的设备只能接收「其他声音」，且同一时间只能连接一台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast stops receiving and starts sending this Mac's audio again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 将停止接收，重新开始发送这台 Mac 的声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SideCast volume": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SideCast 音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound from apps you haven't set separately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有单独设置的应用的声音。"
