    },
    "macOS asks for these the first time SideCast needs them. You can change them in System Settings › Privacy & Security.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 会在 SideCast 首次需要时请求这些权限，你也可以在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性」中更改。"
